      "label": "Owners of assessed units (type codes 200–299) owned by private persons and total assessed value for share owned by type code, assessed value category, sex and age of owner. Year 2003-2024",
      "source": "Statistics Sweden",
      "updated": "2025-02-27T07:00:00Z",
      "link": {
